5,1,1,talk,George,,We need to understand why the silence happened last month before fixing the schedule.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"The friction isn't about the car, it's about the invisible labor of coordination.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I need to know if the car is actually ready when I need it, not just on paper.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I want to see the raw data on who actually drives versus who just assumes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I feel like we are guessing too much about the money and the miles.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, is the labor really the issue, or is it the lack of clear boundaries?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,It is the labor. Every trip requires setup and cleanup that no one logs.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, raw data helps, but I care more about the condition of the vehicle.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, condition is part of the cost. I need to see the fuel receipts.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I think looking at the tax papers might help us see the total yearly cost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,I will look into what other households did to avoid this exact sourness.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I need to see the hours of use recorded in the diary to quantify the effort.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the state of the car at handover to see if it is neglected.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will look into last year's fuel receipts to see the actual consumption patterns.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I will look into last year's tax, insurance and parking papers to get the fixed costs.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,Let's see what the data says before we argue about feelings again.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. Numbers are safer than assumptions.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I hope the handover notes show if someone is leaving it dirty or empty.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I just want to know if the split is actually even or if it is a myth.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,"I am a little nervous, but I hope the papers will make things clearer for everyone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
