35,2,1,talk,George,,I found that asking for favours and checking figures both made things worse.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The diary shows usage is wildly uneven, and checking figures caused the most conflict.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The handover notes show the car is often left with low fuel and trash inside.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The fuel receipts show two people bought over half the fuel, and the diary shows Saturday use is triple Tuesday.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The tax papers show fixed costs are 280,000 yen, and the fuel receipts show two people bought most of the fuel.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,George,,"@Toshio, if checking figures caused conflict, maybe we should avoid a strict audit system.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@George, I agree. The diary shows the labor is hidden, but auditing it creates resentment.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Misaki, if Saturday use is triple, the flat split is unfair, but I need the car ready on Tuesdays.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, the data confirms the split is not even. We need to account for the heavy use days.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minato,,I am surprised by the fixed costs. It is a lot of money that does not change.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,George,,We need a system that doesn't require constant checking or asking for favours.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"A simple log of hours might work, but we must not turn it into a police check.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Victoria,,I need a guarantee that the car is clean and fueled before I use it on a plain morning.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I think we should look at the mechanic's remarks to see if the heavy use is damaging the car.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minato,,I think we should try recording every run for a month to see if it feels natural.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,George,,I am worried that any new system will just become the next thing we argue about.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"If we keep it simple, it might work. The diary shows the problem is the hidden labor, not the car.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"I will support a system that ensures the car is ready, but I am anxious about the extra work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"I am calm, but I know the data shows the current split is not fair. We need to fix that.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minato,,I hope we can find a way that feels peaceful and fair for everyone.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
