63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A is the only one that accounts for the actual distance and usage differences we saw in the data.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minato,,"I like Option A because it feels fair, but I am a little worried about the extra work of recording.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,George,,"@Misaki, if we use Option A, we must make sure the recording is simple and not a source of conflict.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
