72,3,3,talk,Victoria,,I will support Option A if we agree that the car must be left in a clean and fueled state.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I support Option A. The data shows the current split is unfair, and this is the only way to fix it.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minato,,I support Option A. I think it is the most honest way to share the car and the costs.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,George,,"Let's go with Option A, but let's be gentle with each other about the recording.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed. We will keep the log simple and not use it to accuse anyone.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Victoria,,"I am a little anxious, but I will try it. I just need the car to be ready when I need it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I am calm. I think this is the right decision for us.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Minato,,I am happy. I think we can make this work if we are kind to each other.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
